    <guid isPermaLink="false">658f67fcbf3589e8946fa7a2</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 30 Dec 2023 00:44:44 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>₍˄·͈༝·͈˄*₎◞ ̑̑最近你看王家卫的《繁花》了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>⌛️能让拖延症晚期患者的我愣是在2023年末更完这一期，</span></p><span></span><p><span>“墨镜王”功不可没！😎</span></p><span></span><p><span>不吹不黑，🎤来说说我的</span><strong><span>《繁花》启示录</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><span>「表面是飲食男女，裏面是山河歲月、時代變遷。」</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FriDYVz8q7UQNBFeTKOtx3JDOBMI.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>🎵本期BGM</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>黄龄《入画江湖》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>上海彩虹室内合唱团《卖花姑娘》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>林宝《得不到的爱情》（沪语版）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>黄龄《风月》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>方糖泡泡《杳杳》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>上海彩虹室内合唱团《魔都，魔都》</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>📖本期额外书单：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/1033922//" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/1033922//"><span>《英格力士》</span></a><span>——王刚著</span></p>]]></description>
